#: data/events.json events/0/title
msgid "Altar Olvidado"
msgstr "Forgotten Altar"

#: data/events.json events/1/title
msgid "Fuente Luminosa"
msgstr "Luminous Fountain"

#: data/events.json events/2/title
msgid "Forjador Errante"
msgstr "Wandering Smith"

#: data/events.json events/3/title
msgid "Cofre Maldito"
msgstr "Cursed Chest"

#: data/events.json events/4/title
msgid "Hongos Brillantes"
msgstr "Glowing Mushrooms"

#: data/events.json events/5/title
msgid "Mercader Fantasma"
msgstr "Phantom Merchant"

#: data/events.json events/6/title
msgid "Rival Misterioso"
msgstr "Mysterious Rival"

#: data/events.json events/0/text
msgid "Entre la niebla hallas un altar cubierto de runas. Parece pedir algo a cambio de su poder."
msgstr "Through the fog you find an altar covered in runes. It seems to want something in exchange for its power."

#: data/events.json events/1/text
msgid "Una fuente de agua luminosa brota de entre las rocas. Sus aguas parecen tener propiedades extrañas."
msgstr "A spring of glowing water bubbles up between the rocks. Its waters seem to have strange properties."

#: data/events.json events/2/text
msgid "Un herrero ambulante con su yunque portátil te ofrece sus servicios."
msgstr "A traveling blacksmith with a portable anvil offers you his services."

#: data/events.json events/3/text
msgid "Un cofre ornamentado emite un susurro inquietante. El oro asoma entre sus grietas."
msgstr "An ornate chest gives off an unsettling whisper. Gold peeks out between its cracks."

#: data/events.json events/4/text
msgid "Un círculo de hongos luminosos crece junto al camino. Parecen comestibles... quizá."
msgstr "A circle of glowing mushrooms grows by the path. They look edible... maybe."

#: data/events.json events/5/text
msgid "Una figura translúcida te saluda con una sonrisa vacía y abre su capa llena de curiosidades."
msgstr "A translucent figure greets you with a hollow smile and opens a cloak full of curiosities."

#: data/events.json events/6/text
msgid "Un guerrero encapuchado bloquea el camino y desenvaina su arma: \"Muéstrame de qué estás hecha\"."
msgstr "A hooded warrior blocks the path and draws his weapon: \"Show me what you're made of.\""

#: data/events_extra.json events/0/title
msgid "Biblioteca Sumergida"
msgstr "Sunken Library"

#: data/events_extra.json events/1/title
msgid "El Jugador de Dados"
msgstr "The Dice Player"

#: data/events_extra.json events/2/title
msgid "Espejo de las Musas"
msgstr "Mirror of the Muses"

#: data/events_extra.json events/3/title
msgid "Peregrina Herida"
msgstr "Wounded Pilgrim"

#: data/events_extra.json events/4/title
msgid "Un Recuerdo"
msgstr "A Memory"

#: data/events_extra.json events/5/title
msgid "Barco Naufragado"
msgstr "Shipwreck"

#: data/events_extra.json events/6/title
msgid "Ojo en la Marea"
msgstr "Eye in the Tide"

#: data/events_extra.json events/7/title
msgid "Árbol de los Susurros"
